### Se om man är inloggad
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/sign-in/email
Origin: http://localhost:3000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "emilyfranceskolar@gmail.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

###Hämta alla produkter
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products


###Hämta en specifik produkt  avänder samma som ovanför + produktNr
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/115


###Skapa en ny produkt 
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products


###Uppdatera en produkt
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/products/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated product title",
  "description": "Updated product description",
  "price": 149.99,
  "stock": 25,
  "salePrice": 129.99,
  "slug": "updated-product-title"
}


###Radera en produkt
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/products/999
